    <string name="atlas_insight_shape_returner">Life at home turns round two places. They account for %1$d% of how far your visits spread.</string>
    <string name="atlas_insight_shape_explorer">You range well beyond your two main places. They account for only %1$d% of how far your visits spread.</string>
