    <string name="atlas_sync_howto_title">Bringing your history up to date</string>
    <string name="atlas_sync_howto_body">Google keeps Timeline on your phone. To bring it here, open the phone's Settings, then Location, Location services, Timeline, and tap Export Timeline data. Save the file into the Drive folder the server watches. It is read within the hour, and this app fetches what changed the next time it opens.</string>

